# POLLY, a fill plays with the mutes of the section it leads into: section 1 (P1, Groove A) with the drums muted (D1 D2
# PC) into section 2 (P1, Groove B): its bars without drums, its fill (the last bar) with them; section 2 also muted:
# the fill stays without. Pop 105 BPM (a bar 2286 ms), the Intro 2 bars, then section 1 (4 bars) from ~4.6 s.
wait 300
tap HOME
tapkey w0
tapkey w0
expect rows 2
turn K1 -2
expect cursor 1
tapkey b0
tapkey b1
tapkey b2
expect row_mute1 7
turn K1 1
expect cursor 2
turn K3 3 200
expect row_sect2 2
# ---- section 1's bars: the drums out; its fill bar (into the full section 2): in
tap PLAY
wait 8000
expect row 1
expect sect 2
expect mutes 7
hitreset
wait 4500
expect row 1
expect sect 4
expect mutes 0
expect track_hits1 >0
tap PLAY
wait 300
# ---- section 2 muted too: the fill into it stays without drums
turn K1 9
turn K1 -1
expect cursor 2
tapkey b0
tapkey b1
tapkey b2
expect row_mute2 7
tap PLAY
wait 12500
expect row 1
expect sect 4
expect mutes 7
tap PLAY
